at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1000115","city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,53,79,84,80,70],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017305","helmet":"WP1026805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1011","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[73,53,79,84,80,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017305","helmet":"WP1026805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10001","city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,53,79,84,80,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"98","reputation":"2300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017305","helmet":"WP1026805"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"三国时期曹魏大臣、思想家、政治家。孙权响应诸葛攻魏时，奉命前往江夏抵御陆逊的进攻。著有《论略》《人物志》《三都赋》等，《人物志》是中国历史上第一部人才学专著，设计了曹魏官员考课制度。打破了固有的偏重儒家，以道德修养选拔人才的局面，对开启品评人物的清谈风气有一定作用，民间传说其著作被司马懿奉为圭臬。正始年间去世，追赠光禄勋。","tc":"三國時期曹魏大臣、思想家、政治家。孫權響應諸葛攻魏時，奉命前往江夏抵御陸遜的進攻。著有《論略》《人物志》《三都賦》等，《人物志》是中國歷史上第一部人才學專著，設計了曹魏官員考課制度。打破了固有的偏重儒家，以道德修養選拔人才的局面，對開啟品評人物的清談風氣有一定作用，民間傳說其著作被司馬懿奉為圭臬。正始年間去世，追贈光祿勛。","en":"A minister, thinker, and statesman of Cao Wei during the Three Kingdoms period. When Sun Quan responded to Zhuge Liang's attack on Wei, he was ordered to Jiangxia to repel Lu Xun's offensive. He authored works including ‘A Discourse on Strategy’, ‘A Treatise on the Evaluation of Men’, and ‘Rhapsody on the Three Capitals’. ‘A Treatise on the Evaluation of Men’ was the first specialized work on personnel assessment in Chinese history. He designed the official performance evaluation system for Cao Wei, breaking the traditional over-reliance on Confucian moral cultivation as the sole criterion for talent selection. His work had a notable influence on the rise of the pure conversation movement that valued character appraisal. Folk tradition holds that Sima Yi regarded his writings as an invaluable guide. He passed away during the Zhengshi era and was posthumously granted the title of Chancellor.","jp":"三国時代の曹魏の臣、思想家、政治家。孫権が諸葛に呼応して魏を攻めた際、命を受けて江夏へ赴き陸遜の進攻を防いだ。著書に『論略』『人物志』『三都賦』などがある。『人物志』は中国史上初の人材論に関する専門書であり、曹魏における官吏の考課制度を策定した。従来の儒教偏重や道徳的修養による人材選抜のあり方を打破し、人物を品評する清談の風潮を開く一助となった。民間伝承では、その著作は司馬懿に規範として重用されたと伝えられている。正始年間に没し、光禄勲を追贈された。","kr":"삼국시대 조위의 대신이자 사상가, 정치가이다. 손권이 제갈의 위나라 공격에 호응했을 때, 명을 받고 강하로 가 육손의 진격을 막아냈다. 저서로는 《논략》, 《인물지》, 《삼도부》 등이 있으며, 《인물지》는 중국 역사상 최초의 인재학 전문 저서로 조위 관리들의 고과 제도를 입안했다. 유학에 편중되어 도덕적 수양을 기준으로 인재를 선발하던 기존의 구도를 타파하고 인물을 품평하는 청담의 기풍을 여는 데 일조하였으며, 민간에서는 그의 저작을 사마의가 귀감으로 삼았다는 이야기가 전해진다. 정시 연간에 세상을 떠났으며 광록훈으로 추증되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10655","remark":"","surname":"刘","surnameTc":"劉","surnameEn":"Liu","surnameJp":"劉","surnameKr":"유","surnameOther":"","name":"劭","nameTc":"劭","nameEn":"Shao","nameJp":"劭","nameKr":"소","nameOther":"","word":"孔才","wordTc":"孔才","wordEn":"Kongcai","wordJp":"孔才","wordKr":"공재","wordOther":"","icon":"刘劭","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"212","city":"CS1011","gender":"0","rule":"73","force":"53","wise":"79","politics":"84","charm":"80","will":"70","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"5","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"10","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"14/14/50/14/14/75/50/14","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1002105","warSoulPoint":"4600","battleSoulPoint":"2800","debateSoulPoint":"6000","strategy":"1004208","strategy2":"","professions":"1/3/1/3/1/0/1